            "text": "UPI fraud detection leverages machine learning (ML) models to identify fraudulent transactions in real-time, focusing on features such as transaction amount, geolocation, frequency, and user behavior. The optimal approach employs ensemble methods like Random Forest for robustness and versatility, while addressing challenges like imbalanced datasets and real-time processing constraints.",
